  #line-at(70.824pt, 72.72pt, "direction across the plate thickness. A small-signal harmonic voltage of 1 V was applied to the top electrode, ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 97.94pt, "while the bottom electrode was grounded. The complex admittance was then calculated from the simulated ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 123.26pt, "terminal current as (Y = I/V). Mechanically free boundary conditions were applied to the exposed plate ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 148.58pt, "surfaces and lateral edges to isolate the intrinsic resonator response. Electric field norm and displacement ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 173.9pt, "mode shapes were extracted at the resonance peaks to distinguish the principal TS mode from lateral standing ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 199.22pt, "wave spurious modes. ")
