  #line-at(70.824pt, 72.72pt, "Design definition: ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(162.86pt, 72.72pt, "In this work, “lateral-boundary apodization” refers to modification of the physical ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 87.26pt, "LiNbO₃ plate contour to reduce electrically visible spurious responses, as distinct from electrode apodization ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 101.78pt, "or a formal multi-parameter geometric optimization. The tested outlines were selected to explore variations ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 116.3pt, "in parallel-edge length, curvature, taper, and asymmetry while retaining the thickness-shear active region. ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 130.82pt, "The square reference provides the highly symmetric baseline. Shape 1 removes most straight parallel edges ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 145.46pt, "but remains approximately circular and therefore highly symmetric, whereas Shapes 2–5 introduce ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 159.98pt, "progressively more irregular, tapered, concave, and/or curved boundaries. ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.04pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
